&_nc_ohc=Pt_XqsLsLxEQ7kNvwHUgA91&_nc_oc=Adq46VbktjscyeEPgtiWNsXpfGl7-TVc6HFVpkxomKcOmxyDthh5UhuYpdVJnTUWhms&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJKlH65YFSXA5-FdvUchlMWJ01SIjts7vPeqLYPUXgoUw&oe=6AA54EB5"}, {"file_name": "Trailer v1 - Landscape.00_00_22_07.Still004 copy copy.png", "id": "1711395410191159", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619774_1711395413524492_8400896612552052476_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CQEyViClcZIQ7kNvwFxdJTO&_nc_oc=AdrfMoj0odIv2-YRoGgEr2oxUbJZlxQp7mnwmMnIEOipozyhq3MOIFXsaN9EmCoZg4Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIHzKRCAXYt_h-i7K83VakDBs7qBa3AlKInK5oc5y7MJQ&oe=6AA570AE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "JC_Store_Assets_Landscape_NoLogo_4K.png", "id": "2090307324865144", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620429_2090307328198477_2062000649987811648_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xkAA2AfVVyAQ7kNvwH1tJkI&_nc_oc=AdoJvz8WVu-bv8nSjbk2eoZoSBbZmXqboYBXAuFnMIImcdRgEZSYSX5WWVnwPJcjq-A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL-r3vCYEVuJdjOj7YtQ6mGPkU3lVcFmy7sR7nrfJg3Gw&oe=6AA54348"}, "display_name": "Jetpack Clankers", "keywords": ["Racing", "Jetpack", "Speed", "Fly", "Shooting"], "long_description": "# JETS FOR HANDS. WHEELS FOR LEGS. BLASTERS FOR FUN!\n**JETPACK CLANKERS** is a social VR racing game where your hands are jet engines, your legs are wheels, and control is optional.\n\nBlast through giant robot playgrounds. Boost, drift, climb, crash, recover, and hunt for faster lines. Easy to start. Hard to master.\n\n{1569798081184993}\n\n# RACE LIKE A MANIAC\n\nChallenge friends. Chase records. Race ghosts. Or just try to survive.\n\n{2488669861560274}\n\n# TOYS. SPORTS. ARCADE CHAOS.\n\nShoot blasters. Throw stuff. Sink baskets. Smash targets. Play arcade games. Invent your own nonsense.\n\nJetpack Clankers is a giant social playground built for messing around with friends.\n\n{1975100846526648}\n\n# PLAY CLANKBALL\n\nPart soccer. Part jet-powered robot madness.\n\nSteal the ball. Slam into everyone. Bump, shoot and somehow score.\n\n{1049024754378963}\n\n# MAKE NOISE. TRY WEIRD STUFF.\n\nPlay music. Experiment with strange machines. Discover hidden interactions. Create something nobody planned for.\n\n# Features\n\n- Social VR multiplayer\n- Jet-powered hand movement\n- Wheels-for-legs robot locomotion\n- High-speed skill-based racing\n- Racing and leaderboards\n- Blasters and throwable toys\n- Clankball, basketball, mini-games, and arcade games\n- Music-making and experimental interactions\n- Massive arenas and robot playgrounds\n- Chaotic physics-driven VR gameplay\n\nCompete, explore, practice, mess around, or master the art of barely controlled jet-powered flight.\n\n**Race fast. Crash hard. Get better. Repeat.**", "short_description": "A social VR racing game with jet-powered hands, wheels for legs, blasters, and chaotic skill-based flying. Race at extreme speeds, crash, shoot, play Clankball and other mini-games, or just hang out in a massive robot playground."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wooorld.io/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wooorld", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://jetpackclankers.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported